      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i'm a bit worried though, some of the reviewers on the grant committee might argue that managed conservation is actually necessary for protecting endangered species or managing human-wildlife conflict. how should i respond to them so they see their view is just a temporary stopgap and not a long-term solution?",
